    "title": "Brookhaven Shopping Center Hits the Market, Could Sell for $40 Million - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jensen Toussaint ,\n16 hours ago\nA Delaware County shopping center where shoppers pick up groceries and hardware is now up for sale, and investors are expected to compete for it. Brookhaven Shopping Center, a fully leased retail hub anchored by ShopRite and Lowe’s, has hit the market and could sell for as much as $40 million, writes Paul Schwedelson for the Philadelphia Business Journal.\nRead full article",
